<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 44,167 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 44,167 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 44,167 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 7 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Tuesday, compared to 66,790 tonnes on Monday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>					    Tuesday	   Previous</p>
<p>    Export cargo			11,368	     4,822</p>
<p>    Import cargo			32,799	    61,968</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, two ships sailed and one berthed. In the next 24 hours, two ships are expected to sail and 11 to arrive.  </p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at the Karachi Port:</p>
<p>Commodity	     Tonnes/TEUs  Ship			Berthing</p>
<p>Sulpher		 2,000	  Nova-1		    due</p>
<p>General cargo	  582	   Charlotte Sif	   4/6</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
